<h2 class="prose">Phase</h2>
<p class="prose">Back to a linear vertical axis, and a window on it: the phase of a first-order response runs from 0° to −90° and nowhere else, so the axis is told to show exactly that rather than fitting itself to the sampled extremes.</p>
<div class="step note">fn phase defined</div>
<div class="step note">axis y linear</div>
<div class="step note">axis y limits</div>
<div class="step note">axis y &quot;Phase&quot;</div>
<div class="step">plot(phase, 10, 100000)</div>
